  <p class="big">A logo for every team</p>
  <p>
    Each team got its own logo, drawn from the game’s visual universe and the
    personality of its captain, with distinct shapes and color palettes so every
    team stayed instantly recognizable throughout the event.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Inside the setup</p>
  <p>
    The show ran on vMix, split across multiple stations that each handled part
    of the production: cameras, gameplay, graphics and transitions. Their
    signals came together in one main switcher, where the final broadcast was
    built and controlled.
  </p>
</div>

